### Exemples d'appels API (extension REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@base = http://localhost:8000
# @apikey = votre-cle    # decommenter si API_KEY est definie dans .env

### Etat du service
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Configuration effective (sans secrets)
GET {{base}}/api/config

### Verifier l'acces Google Drive
POST {{base}}/api/drive/check

### Creer une cible simple (capture quotidienne a 09h00)
POST {{base}}/api/targets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Page d'accueil",
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "run_time": "09:00"
}

### Creer une cible avancee (cron, masquage de bandeau cookies, sous-dossier Drive)
POST {{base}}/api/targets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rapport hebdo",
  "url": "https://example.com/rapport",
  "cron_expression": "30 8 * * 1",
  "timezone_name": "Africa/Casablanca",
  "viewport_width": 1920,
  "viewport_height": 1080,
  "wait_until": "networkidle",
  "wait_after_load_ms": 3000,
  "hide_selectors": "#cookie-banner;.newsletter-popup",
  "subfolder": "rapports"
}

### Lister les cibles
GET {{base}}/api/targets

### Modifier une cible (changer l'heure)
PATCH {{base}}/api/targets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "run_time": "18:30"
}

### Desactiver une cible
PATCH {{base}}/api/targets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}

### Lancement manuel
POST {{base}}/api/targets/1/run

### Lancement manuel force (ignore la deduplication)
POST {{base}}/api/targets/1/run?force=true

### Taches planifiees et prochaines executions
GET {{base}}/api/scheduler/jobs

### Historique global
GET {{base}}/api/runs?limit=20

### Filtrer les executions en echec
GET {{base}}/api/runs?status=failed

### Executions d'un jour donne
GET {{base}}/api/runs?capture_date=2026-07-20

### Detail d'une execution avec ses logs
GET {{base}}/api/runs/1

### Logs seuls
GET {{base}}/api/runs/1/logs

### Telecharger la capture
GET {{base}}/api/runs/1/screenshot

### Supprimer une cible (et son historique)
DELETE {{base}}/api/targets/1
